WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:01.890
- So also, why you're an amazing human

00:00:01.890 --> 00:00:04.620
is I recently heard that
you love journaling.

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.600
I'm a huge journal kid.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:07.433
- Yeah?

00:00:07.433 --> 00:00:09.380
- No I get a little nervous
about someone finding it, but uh

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:10.213
(chuckling)

00:00:10.213 --> 00:00:11.046
- [Leslie] I know.

00:00:11.046 --> 00:00:12.030
- Cause that's happened to me before,

00:00:12.030 --> 00:00:13.020
someone found it and like read it.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:14.880
And then accused me of what was in it.

00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:17.070
And I was like, that's my mess.

00:00:17.070 --> 00:00:18.290
I was like, wait, what?

00:00:18.290 --> 00:00:19.123
(audience laughing)

00:00:19.123 --> 00:00:20.550
I was like, you jumped in that tornado.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:21.383
That's on you.

00:00:21.383 --> 00:00:22.320
- Right, right.

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.153
- Yeah.

00:00:23.153 --> 00:00:25.440
But like, I love it though,
it makes me feel good

00:00:25.440 --> 00:00:26.550
to get it out.

00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:30.000
- Yeah, it kinda, it's
a yeah, another thing

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.580
that's changing a lot,
will change your life.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:35.790
I started waking up an hour
and a half to two hours

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:37.509
before my wife and my kids.

00:00:37.509 --> 00:00:38.580
- I wanna do that.

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:39.413
So you have you time.

00:00:39.413 --> 00:00:41.100
- It's my me time, you know, journal.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:41.933
I do my yoga.

00:00:41.933 --> 00:00:43.170
I drink my coffee and stuff.

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:46.114
And it's a chance for me
to find out where I am

00:00:46.114 --> 00:00:48.780
before the day starts rushing in.

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:50.880
And you know, I've had realizations.

00:00:50.880 --> 00:00:55.320
For the record, you know,
I went through one of those

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:58.680
really tough seasons that's
kinda waiting for everybody.

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:01.620
If you haven't been
through it yet, just wait,

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:02.680
it's coming, you know.

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:03.513
- Yeah.

00:01:03.513 --> 00:01:04.346
- But you know, one of those seasons

00:01:04.346 --> 00:01:05.340
and I journal through the whole thing.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:07.710
And I really was just
honestly trying to make it

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:08.880
to the other side of that.

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:09.713
- [Kelly] Yeah

00:01:09.713 --> 00:01:11.460
- And I never was thinking

00:01:11.460 --> 00:01:14.340
that I would use it creatively in any way.

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:17.100
But it dawned on me this one day

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:19.350
as I was listening to music.

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:23.629
And music was such a balm
and such a guiding light--

00:01:23.629 --> 00:01:24.920
- Oh yeah.
- [Leslie] Through that time.

00:01:24.920 --> 00:01:25.753
- It's healing.

00:01:25.753 --> 00:01:27.780
- It was like, I'm supposed to use this.

00:01:27.780 --> 00:01:30.210
I'm supposed to write about this.

00:01:30.210 --> 00:01:31.680
If I'm supposed to make the record

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:36.240
that I needed to listen to
when I'm going through this.

00:01:36.240 --> 00:01:38.609
- You mind if I tag into
the journaling conversation

00:01:38.609 --> 00:01:39.442
you were having.

00:01:39.442 --> 00:01:40.275
- [Kelly] Yes, do you journal?

00:01:40.275 --> 00:01:41.108
- I do.

00:01:41.108 --> 00:01:44.010
I say this and especially,
you just played a clip from.

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:47.370
But I find if you write
down every few nights

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:50.040
what you're saddest
about or angriest about,

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:52.230
you can start to see
your own life as a story.

00:01:52.230 --> 00:01:53.880
And when you see your own life as a story,

00:01:53.880 --> 00:01:56.850
sometimes you can zoom out and
encourage the main character

00:01:56.850 --> 00:01:58.230
to make better decisions.

00:01:58.230 --> 00:01:59.313
- Wow.

